---
source: crates/jailint/tests/rules.rs
---
error[misrefactored_assign_op]: `total += total + ...` applies `+` to `total` twice
  --> tests/lint/misrefactored_assign_op/example.jai:7:5
   |
 7 |     total += total + price;
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: `+=` already starts from `total`: write `total += price`
   |
 7 ~     total += price;
   |
   = note: `misrefactored_assign_op` is `deny` by default
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/misrefactored_assign_op/
